## Key files (cite these, do not invent paths)

- App identity: `app.config.ts`, `src/constants/app.ts`
- Navigation gate: `src/navigation/Application.tsx`; routes in `src/navigation/paths.ts` + `types.ts`
- Theme tokens + `useTheme`: `src/theme/`
- Data layer: `src/services/queryClient.ts`, feature `api/` folders
- Client state: `src/store/`, `src/storage/appStorage.ts`
- i18n: `src/translations/en-EN.json` (namespace `<%= i18nNamespace %>`)
